It's very difficult to do that.

00:46:50.884 --> 00:46:51.717
Yeah.
That's why people could

00:46:51.717 --> 00:46:52.980
be helpful in that.

00:46:52.980 --> 00:46:55.170
But sometimes you like,

00:46:55.170 --> 00:46:57.780
because even when it comes
to the choices you're making,

00:46:57.780 --> 00:46:58.613
that, I mean, the whole,

00:46:58.613 --> 00:46:59.940
"Show me your friends and
I'll show you your future."

00:46:59.940 --> 00:47:01.500
The reason that makes sense,

00:47:01.500 --> 00:47:02.430
and to some degree,

00:47:02.430 --> 00:47:04.350
it's not, you know,

00:47:04.350 --> 00:47:07.983
it's not like, an airtight
always true thing, but.

00:47:09.060 --> 00:47:11.220
The reason is that we, a lot of times

00:47:11.220 --> 00:47:13.590
make decisions about who we're
gonna surround ourselves with

00:47:13.590 --> 00:47:16.200
based on current needs.

00:47:16.200 --> 00:47:19.080
Needs for acceptance, most often.

00:47:19.080 --> 00:47:20.730
Need for belonging.

00:47:20.730 --> 00:47:22.680
And those things are not
bad in and of themselves.

00:47:22.680 --> 00:47:25.650
But if you're finding
acceptance and belonging

00:47:25.650 --> 00:47:28.530
with people who don't have
your best interest in mind,

00:47:28.530 --> 00:47:29.640
then your future self,

00:47:29.640 --> 00:47:31.530
wishes they could come
back to your present self

00:47:31.530 --> 00:47:33.420
and say, "Ah, don't make that decision."

00:47:33.420 --> 00:47:34.380
So that's the thing,

00:47:34.380 --> 00:47:39.380
try to anticipate, "What would
my future self want me to,

00:47:39.480 --> 00:47:40.860
what kind of decisions would they want me

00:47:40.860 --> 00:47:41.810
to make right now?"

00:47:43.200 --> 00:47:46.855
It's very tough to do
that, but you have to try.

00:47:46.855 --> 00:47:48.420
You have to try to.
Yeah.

00:47:48.420 --> 00:47:49.253
Especially when it comes to

00:47:49.253 --> 00:47:51.270
who you're choosing to associate with.

00:47:51.270 --> 00:47:52.380
Yeah.

00:47:52.380 --> 00:47:54.840
That phrase of like "Finding your people,"

00:47:54.840 --> 00:47:58.470
